{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2dbfcb61-664e-80b2-8745-0db124a3527a",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T10:37:05-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmela Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:34:50-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:34:53-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin, good morning. This is Carmela Ricci. I'm calling about my trash, dear. Or really the couch, I want to put a couch out and I don't know how that works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:35:05-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Bulk items like a couch usually need to be set up for pickup, so let me get your address first. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:35:16-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "322 Bacheller Street. That's in the Fifth Ward. My father used to walk to the, oh, never mind that. Three twenty-two Bacheller."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:35:24-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 322 Bacheller Street. And you said a couch. Anything else going out with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:35:30-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, just the couch. And, well, here's the other thing. They missed me last week and they missed me again this week. That's two in a row now. I had the barrel out at the curb and everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:35:43-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so two missed pickups in a row. I'm writing that down. Which day is your regular pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:35:50-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. Yesterday was Monday. The barrel's still sitting there, full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:35:54-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, and somebody told me the district posted a new schedule for the winter break. Maybe that's what happened? I never saw it. I don't see so well, and the paper they sent, I wouldn't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:36:07-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That could be part of it. There was a revised schedule posted for the winter break, and some routes shifted. I'll flag your street as missed both weeks so the crew gets it checked. I'd leave the barrel at the curb for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:36:22-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'll leave it. And the couch, should I put it out with the barrel? It's a big green one, my sister had it in her, oh, sorry, dear. The couch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:36:33-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Hold off putting the couch out until I've got it scheduled, so it doesn't sit there. I'll put in a bulk pickup request for 322 Bacheller and someone will confirm the day with you. Is 401-555-0150 the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:36:47-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one. The landline. I'm always here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:36:51-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So, missed pickup two weeks running, plus a bulk couch request, callback at that number. You're all set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:36:58-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. That's very kind. Goodbye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:37:02-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mrs. Ricci. Take care."
    }
  ],
